#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
msgid ""
"Welcome to Bali, Indonesia’s enchanted island where lush emerald landscapes, "
"ancient spiritual traditions, and serene coastal beauty blend into pure "
"paradise. Known for its warm hospitality and vibrant artistic heritage, Bali "
"is a haven for travelers seeking both tranquility and adventure."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
msgid ""
"Welcome to New York City, the world’s most dynamic metropolis where soaring "
"skyscrapers, diverse neighborhoods, and nonstop ambition create an "
"atmosphere unlike anywhere else on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"Welcome to Rome, the open-air museum where thousands of years of history "
"live quietly alongside the vibrant pulse of modern Italian life. As the "
"cradle of Western civilization, Rome captivates travelers with its grand "
"monuments, sunlit piazzas, and an effortless sense of style that has endured "
"for millennia."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
msgid ""
"Welcome to Sydney, Australia’s stunning harbour city where world-class "
"architecture meets effortless coastal living. Built around one of the "
"world's grandest natural harbors, Sydney is famous for its golden beaches, "
"sparkling blue waters, and a laid-back lifestyle that embraces the great "
"outdoors."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model:product.public.category,name:guided_tours.product_public_category_6
msgid "Wellness"
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"We’re committed to providing prompt and effective solutions to ensure your "
"satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"Chúng tôi cam kết cung cấp các giải pháp nhanh chóng và hiệu quả để đảm bảo "
"sự hài lòng của bạn."

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
msgid ""
"Whether it’s your first time in the Big Apple or you're returning to "
"rediscover its magic, New York will dazzle you, and our bus tour gives you "
"the ultimate front-row seat.<br>"
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_4
msgid ""
"Whether you are a lifelong history enthusiast, a lover of art and "
"architecture, or simply looking to soak up the Mediterranean sunshine, Rome "
"will steal your heart, and our tour ensures you see it all with ease."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
msgid ""
"Whether you're drawn by spiritual discovery, pristine natural beauty, or the "
"warm island culture, Bali promises a magical escape, and our tour delivers "
"the complete experience effortlessly."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
msgid ""
"Whether you’re a sun-seeker, an architectural fan, or an urban adventurer, "
"Sydney will captivate you, and our tour guarantees you experience its iconic "
"highlights in complete comfort."
msgstr ""

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guided_tours.view_page_about_us
